---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site";
---

<Base title="What I do" description="Growth at Ghost Note, operations at Integral, and Fredo’s House.">
  <h1>What I do</h1>

  <p class="label">growth</p>
  <h3><a href="https://www.ghostnoteagency.com">Ghost Note</a></h3>
  <p>I help the agency grow.</p>
  <p>
    That means finding new opportunities, building relationships, talking to
    people, understanding what they need, and connecting the right people to the
    right work.
  </p>
  <p>
    I like the relationship part most. I’m not really interested in selling
    someone something they don’t need.
  </p>
  <p>
    I’d rather meet someone, understand what they’re trying to do, and see if
    there’s a reason we should work together.
  </p>

  <p class="label">operations</p>
  <h3>Integral</h3>
  <p>I help keep the machine moving.</p>
  <p>
    There are usually a hundred little things happening at once — timelines,
    clients, teams, budgets, decisions, handoffs.
  </p>
  <p>My job is often to look at all of it and figure out what needs to happen next.</p>
  <p>I’m good at taking something that feels messy and making it feel manageable.</p>

  <p class="label">my corner</p>
  <h3>Fredo’s House</h3>
  <p>This is my little corner of the internet.</p>
  <p>
    I write about work, growth, operations, agency life, money, relationships,
    ideas I’m thinking about, and whatever else I’m trying to figure out.
  </p>
  <p>It’s less of a business and more of a place to think out loud.</p>

  <p class="label">if you want to talk</p>
  <p>
    If you’re building something, running an agency, trying to grow a business,
    or just want to grab a coffee and talk about what’s going on:{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}?subject=Hey%20Fredo`} data-track="email click">{SITE.email}</a>
  </p>
  <p>I read everything.</p>
</Base>

<style>
  h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  h3 a {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
